tig00005515	maker	gene	61160	62185	.	+	.	gene_id "gene6131"; ID "gene6131"; Name "maker-tig00005515-exonerate_protein2genome-gene-0.1"; symbol "CTU1"; description "Plays a central role in 2-thiolation of mcm(5)S(2)U at tRNA wobble positions of tRNA(Lys), tRNA(Glu) and tRNA(Gln). Directly binds tRNAs and probably acts by catalyzing adenylation of tRNAs, an intermediate required for 2-thiolation. It is unclear whether it acts as a sulfurtransferase that transfers sulfur from thiocarboxylated URM1 onto the uridine of tRNAs at wobble position";
